# The ported design tokens.
#
# This file is a port of screens/assets/css/tokens.css and is byte-identical to
# it wherever it can be, which is what lets somebody diff the two and see that
# the port has not drifted from the design source. Formatting it lowercases
# every hex, drops the column alignment the prototype uses to make a palette
# scannable, and splits its selectors, so the diff against the source stops
# saying anything.
#
# It is the only file with this exemption, and it has it because it is the only
# file whose job is to be identical to something outside the repository.
src/shared/styles/tokens.css
